		description = "Shows your saved farm runs in the Ironwise side panel, and the run in progress, started there or on the Ironwise site. The run moves on by itself when you've dealt with each patch. While it's ticked (and Sync with Ironwise is), the plugin asks Ironwise for your runs every 10 seconds while you're logged in, and tells it each run you start or end, each stop you skip or go back from, and each patch or bird house it sees you deal with. Only the account's owner (the device that syncs it) can start, skip or end its runs.",
		warning = "This feature submits your IP address to a 3rd-party server not controlled or verified by RuneLite developers",
